{"title":"Tech & Startup Halloween Mixer (EB tix @ $15))","startsAt":"2026-10-28T18:30:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-28T21:30:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"**On October 28, TechinTO is taking over IDK Social Bar for our Halloween Bash** — and this time, we want you dressed for it.\nIt's the one night a year networking gets to be genuinely fun. Skip the business casual, skip the small talk about the weather — come as your favorite villain, hero, or inside joke, and let's actually do this properly.\n\n**Costumes Strongly Encouraged:** Half the room won't be recognizable, and that's the point. The better the effort, the better the night — ***and we're giving out a prize for best costume, so if you've been sitting on an idea, tonight's the night to use it.***\n\n**Still the Same Unstiff Energy:** No stage, no slides, no pitch deck — just the return of TechinTO's original energy, dressed up for the occasion. Grab a drink, mix and mingle, actually connect. Mask optional, sincerity not.\n\n**Come Ready to Show, Not Just Tell:** Whatever you've shipped, built, or figured out lately — this is the room to talk about it. Swap insight, show off what you're actually working on, and walk away having met someone worth knowing. Bonus points if you can pull it off in character.\n\n**The Crowd:** Entrepreneurs, devs, designers, and marketers who are actually moving the needle in this city — just in costume this time.\n\n**📅 The Details**\n\\- When: Wednesday\\, October 28\\, 2026\n\\- Time: 6:30 PM – 9:30 PM\n\\- Where: IDK Social Bar \\(172 Ossington Ave\\)\n\n**GET YOUR EARLY BIRD TICKETS FOR $15!**\n[https://shop.techinto.ca/products/october-28-networking-event](https://shop.techinto.ca/products/october-28-networking-event)\n\n**Follow the fun:**\n📸 Instagram: [@techinto.event](https://www.instagram.com/techinto.event/)\n🌐 Website: [www.techinto.ca](https://techinto.ca)\n\n### 🍸 Venue Highlight: IDK Social Bar\n\n**IDK Social Bar** is a two-level venue in downtown Toronto that actually understands the assignment. It replaces the usual stiff corporate atmosphere with a genuinely welcoming, cozy vibe. With good drinks and an absolute focus on real energy—this is exactly the room you should be in for actual, human conversations.","venue":{"name":"IDK Social Bar","address":"172 Ossington Ave, Toronto, ON M6J 2Z7, Toronto","lat":43.648113,"lng":-79.42041,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"TechinTO | Toronto's Tech & Startup Network","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/5/8/4/7/highres_536182599.jpeg"}